                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have a geforce gt 430, 4gb ram, not a top pc, but enough to run this, yet it ran very laggy (and apparently i am not the only one).\nSo what do you do? Offcourse try to contact the dev to see if he is willing to look into it.\n\nAfter like 6 months on facebook i finally got their reply.\n\"Haha, who cares how crappy your setup is for a unity driven turd..\" So that's what they think of their customers and their game.\nNo it's not a crappy setup it's crappy optimized.\n\n[Edit] I got another reply stating that the person who wrote me the first comment was from an ex employee with access to their Facebook account, i am willing to believe that. \nHowever the issue of the performance was still not adressed, and i am also questioning if this game has not been abandoned (will there be future episodes?) that's why i keep it negative.",
